": null}, {"sha": "dcbf496c33fab96a681add05ac9a4b7a5f4e079f", "message": "Merge branch 'main' of https://github.com/tillreichardt/Camel-Up", "created_at": "2023-11-12T21:14:45Z", "repo": "Camel-Up", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2d299c050987730ce40dc768ca1d2e73c7e60488", "message": "player name system & autostart\n\nthe user can now manually decide how many players there are and name them through the console\n\nthe game now starts automatically with the Greenfoot.start() methode\n\nproper removal of actioncards on the track", "created_at": "2023-11-12T21:14:44Z", "repo": "Camel-Up", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7891492e87ad68e6aabc81de4fe6f89b1d9081e5", "message": "added image to readme.md", "created_at": "2023-11-12T20:26:48Z", "repo": "Camel-Up", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "09f77d100babe617b291c27e43d7505d6eab98e5", "message": "updated images and a few tweaks\n\ncommented complex parts of the code and removed unnecessary code\n\nupdated the images of camels, camelTrack and the ActionCards\n\nthe player can now only place the actioncards according to the game rules\n\nthe player can no longer take a betcard from an empty betCards stack resulting in an error", "created_at": "2023-11-12T20:23:19Z", "repo": "Camel-Up", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9ff2f4e1959bafe142eb1c0f538676506bb33af2", "message": "final game logic\n\ncovered all edge cases\n\nimproved console prints and graphic prints", "created_at": "2023-11-12T15:53:07Z", "repo": "Camel-Up", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0bcd8a11bae6717568840ca04594ee9b3e4233f5", "message": "finished game logic", "created_at": "2023-11-11T19:45:34Z", "repo": "Camel-Up", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "69d44e032cb47f88580cd92491b5f41bb60bb066", "message": "Endgame Bets (not fully working yet)\n\nadded makeEndGameBet methode to place a bet on a specific camel\n\nadded evaluateEndGameBets methode to award the player with the coins\n\nadded case 4 in act methode\n\nthere is an error somewhere it is not displayed though :(", "created_at": "2023-11-11T09:19:20Z", "repo": "Camel-Up", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9c70e828fcee8d39236af2ffeadfed0c408130e6", "message": "fixed some issues\n\nworking game loop\n\nfixed reset methode in BetCards\n\nadded a remove methode in pyramidCards to remove the cards on the track", "created_at": "2023-11-09T20:54:20Z", "repo": "Camel-Up", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2e5f6037d44f7da0e1257f424e9e8127ccb93ce9", "message": "GameLoop with case 1-3", "created_at": "2023-11-08T10:32:52Z", "repo": "Camel-Up", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d6b8f343bed12b182e8f8cdeeb9d6752bd626ad3", "message": "lastest Update (6.11.)\n\nGameLoop almost working\n\nPyramidCards and PyramidCard is way more cleaner\n\nDiceSet and Dice should work properly now and also far too clean\n\nPlayer has now a methode (addCoins) which should work as intended", "created_at": "2023-11-06T21:33:56Z", "repo": "Camel-Up", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "31193f63deb2d3886f7ac43244d2585a854ee999", "message": "compelte Dicers and DicersSet", "created_at": "2023-11-06T17:07:50Z", "repo": "Camel-Up", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5c314238beded28b492167af2affd2fb04a9f14d", "message": "gameloop (not finished)\n\nstartet to work on the gameloop with the 4 possible moves a player can do", "created_at": "2023-11-06T12:27:08Z", "repo": "Camel-Up", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b589dbd7ca82dfe1242f6b8b105ea340f3760292", "message": "Cards\n\nPyramid Cards and BetCards finished but haven't been tested yet\n\nPlayer can recieve BetCards and adds them into a list\n\nHashMap used for coin values in BetCard class\n\nGame Class now recieves a parameter of the amout of players and creates an array of players with cool names", "created_at": "2023-11-05T21:19:52Z", "repo": "Camel-Up", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "94c8899dd4a32350c6de159cd3faef3975f718dd", "message": "camel placements\n\nsorts the camels array in cameltrack", "created_at": "2023-11-03T19:30:54Z", "repo": "Camel-Up", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d093f8a06b7382a93f4868e6686ef4302b9c7d5f", "message": "lastest update (not working)", "created_at": "2023-11-03T05:58:52Z", "repo": "Camel-Up", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6ee17d78b2b2e1eda4ecfb0de910426fde02e30a", "message": "Pyramid Cards", "created_at": "2023-11-02T09:41:59Z", "repo": "Camel-Up", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9b196796b2f4998f1e01da04d8da1540d43d3495", "message": "complete ActionCard System\n\nDesert- and OasisCard working with a -1 or +1 step. And when you have to move -1 you land below the stack on that -1 position", "created_at": "2023-11-02T07:06:13Z", "repo": "Camel-Up", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f1125543d23351478ce8f682270483317070a8b8", "message": "cards feature", "created_at": "2023-11-01T00:13:29Z", "repo": "Camel-Up", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2e1f6a19ea93575ff8fc3aefc3bb58de37293917", "message": "complete Movement of camels (sui)\n\nAdded getHighestCamel() in camel class (sui)\n\nAdded a for loop in moveCamel methode in CamelTrack class to find the highest camel and let him carry the camelToMove (sui)\n\nenglish names for camelAbove and camelBelow and their methods", "created_at": "2023-10-30T15:43:39Z", "repo": "Camel-Up", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2e81014a9c19c1aa790aa8dc07ac25304ea8460a", "message": "deleted GameBoard.java", "created_at": "2023-10-29T18:41:44Z", "repo": "Camel-Up", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1db5794059bd6fe43fa68aaafd98e3f072eb4826", "message": "besseresMovement (aber immer noch nicht perfekt)\n\nKomplette Camel Movement neu, GameBoard enfernt,\n\nCamel Movement umgestellt von 2D Array auf Objekt basiert.\n\nMount / Dismount function.\n\nNeue printBoard und updateBoard Methode.\n\nkorrekte Berechnung der Position, damit es auf die 50er Grid\n\nVisuelle von Logische Darstellung gekoppelt", "created_at": "2023-10-29T18:40:20Z", "repo": "Camel-Up", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "029e89278613fca9d105e2ba110922f7f24cbeac", "message": "neues Camel movement\n\nklappt noch nicht so ganz, wird \u00fcberarbeitet", "created_at": "2023-10-29T14:44:25Z", "repo": "Camel-Up", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f828fa8cd49c75ac46abac9078da638efc98b022", "message": "Initial commit\n\nabsolut basic game", "created_at": "2023-10-28T06:28:13Z", "repo": "Camel-Up", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bbce0102850c8576af427d662dca77f4e3ba7b6e", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2023-10-28T06:26:31Z", "repo": "Camel-Up", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}], "prs": []}